Bitshuffle
=======================================================================

Upstream: https://github.com/kiyo-masui/bitshuffle
Paper:    https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.00638

Portions of the bitshuffle implementation in this project are derived
from Bitshuffle, originally written by Kiyoshi Masui. The algorithm
(bit-level transpose within a block) is described in the cited paper.
In this project, the code reached us via its adaptation in C-Blosc2
(see below), but the original MIT license terms apply.

