=======================================================================
C-Blosc2
=======================================================================

Upstream: https://github.com/Blosc/c-blosc2
Home:     https://www.blosc.org

Substantial portions of this project are derived from C-Blosc2. The
relationship is best described as a port of ideas to Rust followed by
independent evolution and new features, rather than a direct
translation of a single version. Portions derived from C-Blosc2
include, but are not limited to: the shuffle filter, the bitshuffle
filter integration (see Bitshuffle section above), the chunk and
block two-level partitioning layout, the filter pipeline
architecture, the codec+filter separation, and elements of the
on-disk container format.

